{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterCommutingTransversal","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterCommutingTransversal","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolicTransversal","lean:module:QOU.Machinery.HeckeCommutingCellReduction"],"declarations":24,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.far_commute_at_pair","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.far_commute_at_pair","kind":"theorem","line":341,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterCommutingTransversal.lean#L341-L353","doc":"**THE PAYOFF — far commutation at general rank, from the Coxeter\nsystem**: on the length-rule module `W → R`, the right-multiplication\ndescent actions of any `M i j = 2` pair commute, given only the\ncell-faithfulness residue. Together with `braid_at_pair` and the merged\nall-ranks quadratic, all three Hecke presentation-law kinds now flow from\n`CoxeterSystem` data. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.commutingTransversal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.commutingTransversal","kind":"def","line":295,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterCommutingTransversal.lean#L295-L339","doc":"**The commuting coset structure of any `M i j = 2` pair**, constructed\nfrom the Coxeter system modulo the single faithfulness residue\n`IsReduced [i, j]`. The far-commutation reduction's coset hypothesis,\ndischarged. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cellMap2_bijective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cellMap2_bijective","kind":"theorem","line":256,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterCommutingTransversal.lean#L256-L291","doc":"**The parabolic factorization is a bijection** (`M i j = 2`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cellMap2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cellMap2","kind":"def","line":251,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterCommutingTransversal.lean#L251-L254","doc":"The factorization map `(min reps) × Fin 4 → W`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.isMinRep_unique2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.isMinRep_unique2","kind":"theorem","line":232,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterCommutingTransversal.lean#L232-L249","doc":"**Each coset has a unique minimal representative** (`M i j = 2`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.length_minRep_mul_cell2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.length_minRep_mul_cell2","kind":"theorem","line":226,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterCommutingTransversal.lean#L226-L230","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.mem_parabolic2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.mem_parabolic2","kind":"theorem","line":201,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterCommutingTransversal.lean#L201-L222","doc":"**`W_{i,j}` is exactly the four cell elements** (`M i j = 2`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cell2_mul_simple_j","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cell2_mul_simple_j","kind":"theorem","line":183,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterCommutingTransversal.lean#L183-L197","doc":"Right multiplication by `σⱼ` is the `descentC2σj` table. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cell2_mul_simple_i","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cell2_mul_simple_i","kind":"theorem","line":165,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterCommutingTransversal.lean#L165-L181","doc":"Right multiplication by `σᵢ` is the `descentC2σi` table. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.simple_j_mul_cell2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.simple_j_mul_cell2","kind":"theorem","line":146,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterCommutingTransversal.lean#L146-L163","doc":"Left multiplication by `σⱼ` permutes the cell by `![2, 3, 0, 1]`\n(commutation-bearing entries). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.simple_i_mul_cell2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.simple_i_mul_cell2","kind":"theorem","line":131,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterCommutingTransversal.lean#L131-L144","doc":"Left multiplication by `σᵢ` permutes the cell by `![1, 0, 3, 2]`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cellElem2_injective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cellElem2_injective","kind":"theorem","line":105,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterCommutingTransversal.lean#L105-L127","doc":"The four cell elements are pairwise distinct, given the faithfulness\nresidue. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cellWord2_isReduced","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cellWord2_isReduced","kind":"theorem","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterCommutingTransversal.lean#L96-L103","doc":"Every cell word is reduced, given the faithfulness residue. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.simple_ne_of_reduced2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.simple_ne_of_reduced2","kind":"theorem","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterCommutingTransversal.lean#L88-L94","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.wordProd_ij","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.wordProd_ij","kind":"theorem","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterCommutingTransversal.lean#L85-L86","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.commute2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.commute2","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Machinery/CoxeterCommutingTransversal.lean#L74-L81","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cellElem2_3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Machinery.CoxeterParabolic.cellElem2_3","kin